grees on left (severe pain); Seated — negative at 80 degrees (see Waddell signs above)\n\n**Surveillance Video Review** (provided by insurer): Shows examinee 2 weeks ago lifting two grocery bags from car trunk (estimated 15-20 lbs each), pushing a lawn mower for approximately 30 minutes, and bending repeatedly to pick up yard debris.',
