physical examination\n- Note inconsistencies between examination, surveillance, and self-report\n- Impairment rating reflects the organic condition (disc herniation) — behavioral overlay is addressed separately\n- Distinguish between impairment (medical concept — objective loss of function) and disability (legal/administrative concept — inability to perform specific job duties)',
