s NOT manage medications in an IME — recommendations are made to the treating physician\n\n**Additional Recommendations**:\n- Mental health evaluation and treatment for depression and anxiety\n- Weight management program (BMI 34 contributes to back pain)\n- Independent exercise program emphasizing core stabilization and aerobic conditioning\n- Consider CBT for pain-related catastrophizing and fear-avoidance behavior',
